gejyspa:
> LMW, (IMHO) is Gleki's personal plaything.  I personally give it no=20
imprimatur of officialdom.  YMMV

Well, it's a wiki. A wiki used by only one person will always be that=20
person's personal plaything. If more people contribute, it won't be.

Also, it's a(nother =85) wiki hosted on 'the official website'. That's a=20
resource that the community can use if it so chooses. If you don't want the=
=20
wiki to be a 'Gleki wiki', then you can always contribute.=20

While, naturally, I may not agree with Gleki on everything he puts there,=
=20
or rather, not find the same aspects of Lojbanism interesting as he does, I=
=20
think the wiki is a potentially useful and fun thing. If I had more things=
=20
to say about Lojban than I actually have, I'd be more active there.

